				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "y2Rs6mwEQduzV96nPlai7A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Construction\nTiers are built as a simple linked list.\n\n`tdOne tierAppend: tdTwo.`\n### Reading\n\nNormal use is read only.\n \n `aClient vault api_key`\n or\n `aClient vault at: #api_key.`\n \n **For case insensitive use:**\n \nFully parsed items in the options dictionary are all normalized to lowercase.\n### Writing\nWriting only applies to the wrapped dictionary of the frontmost tier. \n \n`aClient config at: #this put: 'that'`\n### Enabling/Disabling\n This implementation allows for reconfiguring the tiers without dismantling the structure,\n each tier can be individually disabled or re-enabled.\n \n `(td tierAt: #config) beDisabled.`"
			}
		]
